WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.256
Lab 2 uses a test tenant with a
leaver workflow in Book 3's order;

2
00:00:04.256 --> 00:00:05.988
the authors haven't run it.

3
00:00:05.988 --> 00:00:09.212
Register a reader app with
only the two permissions.

4
00:00:09.212 --> 00:00:14.220
Give one test user a leave date a few
hours ahead and wait for the scheduled run,

5
00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:16.801
and run the leaver on demand for a second.

6
00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:19.921
Export the logs, and
confirm which activity the

7
00:00:19.921 --> 00:00:22.962
revoke task really wrote,
and who initiated it.

8
00:00:22.962 --> 00:00:23.937
Then measure.

9
00:00:23.937 --> 00:00:27.076
Each block should include the
wait for the tenant schedule.

10
00:00:27.076 --> 00:00:29.090
Finally, back everything out.
